CPEDAL 1
NAME "Fat Fuzz Factory Reference"

# Fuzz Factory signal path plus a three-position Fat switch. The centre position
# leaves the stock 100n interstage capacitor alone. The outer positions add
# 470n or 3.3u in parallel, matching the common verified DIY Fat Fuzz Factory
# implementation and the supplied Effects Layouts reference.
#
# Q2/Q3 use separate compact AC128 gain bins (about 70 and 110 hFE).
# Power-protection and indicator-LED parts are omitted from the audio model.

V VCCSRC VCC 0 9
AUDIO GUITAR INPUT 0 0.20

R R_IN_PD INPUT 0 1M
C C1 INPUT Q1B 10u

R R1 Q1C Q1B 220k
Q Q1 Q1C Q1B 0 2N3904

POT STAB VCC VCC STAB_RAIL 5k LIN 1.0
R R2 STAB_RAIL Q1C 10k

# Stock coupling capacitor plus switchable parallel Fat capacitors.
C C2 Q1C Q2B 100n
C C_FAT Q1C FAT_A 470n
C C_SUPER_FAT Q1C FAT_B 3.3u
SWITCH FAT ONOFFON Q2B FAT_A FAT_B CENTER "Fat" "Normal" "Super Fat"

# The 47k feedback/bias resistor returns from Q2 base to the shared
# Q3-emitter / COMP-DRIVE node, matching the stock Fuzz Factory core.
R R4 Q3E Q2B 47k
PNP Q2 Q2C Q2B STAB_RAIL AC128_LOW

R R3 Q2C GATE_TOP 470
POT GATE 0 0 GATE_TOP 10k LIN 0.0

POT COMP Q3E Q3E STAB_RAIL 10k LIN 0.2
POT DRIVE STAB_RAIL DRIVE_W Q3E 10k LIN 0.5
C C3 DRIVE_W STAB_RAIL 10u

PNP Q3 Q3C Q2C Q3E AC128_HIGH

R R5 Q3C VOL_TOP 5k1
POT VOLUME 0 VOL_W VOL_TOP 5k LIN 0.3
C C4 VOL_W OUT 10u
R R6 OUT 0 220k

OUTPUT OUT 1
